[{"sha":"84d2dfa41ddb32c7b33cea8aacbb7e36ff0a981d","node_id":"C_kwDOEFLz89oAKDg0ZDJkZmE0MWRkYjMyYzdiMzNjZWE4YWFjYmI3ZTM2ZmYwYTk4MWQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/84d2dfa41ddb32c7b33cea8aacbb7e36ff0a981d","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/84d2dfa41ddb32c7b33cea8aacbb7e36ff0a981d","author":{"name":"max","email":"max@example.com","date":"2026-07-07T16:56:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"max","email":"max@example.com","date":"2026-07-07T16:56:26Z"},"tree":{"sha":"517ca6c4f7d71c02d872ddcbc5e5a90f9b0116e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/trees/517ca6c4f7d71c02d872ddcbc5e5a90f9b0116e5"},"message":"state: clear stale expiry so tagged nodes can re-authenticate after logout\n\nA tagged node that runs `tailscale logout` could never log back in with an\nauth key. `tailscale logout` sends a past expiry, and handleLogout stamps it\non the node with no IsTagged guard, so a tagged node (which has key-expiry\ndisabled and never expires) ends up Expired. On the next\n`tailscale up --auth-key`, HandleNodeFromPreAuthKey saw the node as expired and\ntook the expired-node validation path, re-validating and rejecting the\nalready-spent one-shot key with \"authkey already used\" (an infinite\nre-register loop for reusable keys).\n\nExclude tagged nodes from the expired-node validation gate and clear a stale\npast expiry on re-registration, restoring the \"tagged nodes never expire\"\ninvariant. A deliberately set future expiry (headscale nodes expire) is in the\nfuture, so IsExpired is false and it is left untouched.\n\nFixes #3371","parents":[{"sha":"048308511c72fa77da103e932f9b857a6e5247b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/048308511c72fa77da103e932f9b857a6e5247b9","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/048308511c72fa77da103e932f9b857a6e5247b9"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event"